flowchart TD
    A[Student message and conversation history] --> B{Greeting, thanks, or introduction?}
    B -- Yes --> C[Predefined general-conversation reply]
    B -- No --> D{University-policy intent?}
    D -- No --> E[Gemini general-knowledge prompt]
    E --> F{Gemini available?}
    F -- No --> X[Explicit service-unavailable error]
    F -- Yes --> G[General AI answer without policy citations]
    D -- Yes --> H[Classify category and split mixed request]
    H --> I[Retrieve from selected official or fictional collection]
    I --> J{Evidence present?}
    J -- No --> K[Policy information unavailable]
    J -- Yes --> L{Conflict or requested detail absent?}
    L -- Conflict --> M[Conflict response with available source excerpts]
    L -- Detail absent --> K
    L -- No --> N[Selected V1, V2, or V3 prompt plus evidence]
    N --> O{Gemini available?}
    O -- No --> X
    O -- Yes --> P[Structured Gemini policy response]
    P --> Q[Verify document, section, exact quote, and answer]
    Q --> R{All policy claims verified?}
    R -- No --> K
    R -- Yes --> S[Verified university policy with citations]
